dsh-claude-workspace
====================

This package is an independent implementation of the workspace/runtime layer
described in the CCW design note. Its DSH integration follows the packaging and
slot conventions demonstrated by:

  - @zaimokuza/dsh-acp-adapter (MIT License)
  - dsh-memory-journal js-shell (MIT License)

It speaks the Agent Client Protocol to @agentclientprotocol/claude-agent-acp,
which is distributed separately under the Apache License 2.0 and is not bundled
with this package.
